1328:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
1329:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
1330:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: call @ref HAL_TIM_PWM_DeInit() before HAL_TIM_PWM_Init()
