3027:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the TIM Encoder Interface and initialize the associated handle.
3028:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
3029:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
